o the surprise and disbelief of Germany."},{"synopsis":"All of the countries are threatened with embarrassing photos to come to an April Fool's gathering in even more embarrassing costumes."},{"synopsis":"It's Halloween night, and America wants Japan to help him finally win a Halloween prank war against the undefeated England."},{"synopsis":"Santa's missing and Finland is in a crisis. So he pleads for the other nations to spread the holiday cheer this Christmas until Santa can be found."},{"synopsis":"England tells Seychelles that the Prince of England and his wife are going to her place for their honeymoon, but she must keep it secret. And during WWI, Italy forgets his gun, which is later found by Germany."},{"synopsis":"The axis and allies as well as others watch and discuss horror films from their countries."},{"synopsis":"The countries watch more horror films, and realize that horror films from other countries are weird. New Zealand makes his first appearance."},{"synopsis":"Sealand tries to make a new friend: the newest micro-nation, Wy."},{"synopsis":"The Axis Powers celebrate the first year anniversary of the Tripartite Pact."},{"synopsis":"As Sal Valentine's Day gets closer, Germany tries to figure out his relationship with Italy. Meanwhile, Austria tries to come up with a gift for his ex-wife  Hungary."},{"synopsis":"Germany asks Italy out on a date, while Austria and Hungary realize that Germany has been basing himself on a book to help with proposals."}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
